stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Held: pickUp [hand not full] (clears boost)
    Walking --> Held: pickUp [job released] (clears boost)
    Working --> Held: pickUp [job released] (clears boost)
    Held --> Held: drop refused
    Held --> Idle: drop on walkable tile
    Idle --> Idle: Slap (boost = SlapTicks)
    Idle --> Idle: Tick (boost decrements)
